- Data locality and isolation: region-bound embeddings, tenant-scoped caches
- Policy-driven source selection and TTL eviction; PII filters
- Latency budgeting and metrics: p95 targets, caching strategy
- Testing: synthetic workloads, drift checks, leakage tests

